Phone 17 Calculator Privacy Policy

Last updated: December 12, 2025

Introduction

This Privacy Policy describes how Phone 17 Calculator ("we", "our", or "the app") handles information when you use our calculator application.

Information Collection and Use

We do not collect, store, transmit, or share any personal information.

The app is designed with privacy as a core principle. All features work offline, and the app does not require an internet connection to function.

Although the app includes Internet permission, this permission is used only for loading the in-app Privacy Policy page or other optional online resources. No data is ever sent to us or any third parties.

Data Storage
Local Storage Only

All calculation history and app data are stored locally on your device using Android’s DataStore technology. This data:

Never leaves your device

Is not transmitted to any servers

Is not accessible to us or third parties

Is deleted when you uninstall the app

What We Store Locally

The app stores:

Your calculation history (expressions and results)

App preferences and settings

This information is used only to provide the app’s functionality.

Data Sharing

We do not share any data because we do not collect any data.

The app does not:

Connect to external servers

Share data with third parties

Use analytics or tracking services

Display advertisements

Integrate with social media platforms

Permissions

The app may request the following permissions:

1. Internet Permission

Used only to load the Privacy Policy or other optional online resources within the app.

No personal data is transmitted or collected through this permission.

2. Vibration Permission (If used)

Used to provide haptic feedback when pressing calculator buttons.

No data is generated, collected, or transmitted through vibration usage.

The app does not access:

Contacts

Location

Camera or microphone

Photos, media, or files

Network communication beyond loading the Privacy Policy page

Any personal data of any kind

Children’s Privacy

We do not knowingly collect any information from anyone, including children under 13.
The app is safe for users of all ages.

Data Security

Because all data stays on your device, its security depends on your device’s protection.
We recommend:

Using a device password or biometric lock

Keeping your device updated

Enabling device encryption if available

Your Control Over Data

You can:

Delete individual calculations

Clear all history at any time

Uninstall the app to remove all data permanently

Third-Party Services

The app does not use:

Analytics platforms

Advertising networks

Crash reporting tools

Cloud storage services

Changes to This Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Updates will be reflected by the "Last updated" date at the top of this page.
Please review periodically for updates.

International Users

The app can be used worldwide. Since we do not collect or process personal data, there are no cross-border data transfers or regional privacy concerns.

